
[Sutra defaults · D40 <VERSION>] Subagent dispatch reminder (sourced from sutra-defaults.json):
  When invoking the Task tool, prefix the dispatched prompt with this exact line:
    §Sutra discipline (mandatory)
  Followed by the 5 numbered blocks:
    1. Input Routing
    2. Depth + Estimation
    3. Build-Layer marker (if D38 path)
    4. Operationalization 6-section ops block
    5. Codex review per layer
  End the dispatched prompt with the 4-line footer (each on its own line):
    TRIAGE: <values>
    ESTIMATE: <values>
    ACTUAL: <values>
    OS TRACE: <one line>
  See <PLUGIN>/SUTRA-DEFAULTS.md
  Kill-switch: touch ~/.subagent-brief-disabled

